  "steps": [
    "Slice the onions and cook them slowly in the olive oil with half the salt, adding splashes of water when they stick, until deeply caramelised.",
    "Add the beef broth, Worcestershire, garlic, rosemary and thyme and reduce for a couple of minutes into a thick onion mixture. Set aside.",
    "Fry the pancetta in the same pot until crispy, season with pepper and set aside.",
    "Make a white sauce on the fond: melt the butter, stir in the flour, then whisk in the milk gradually and season with salt, pepper and rosemary.",
    "Thinly slice the potatoes and layer them in a baking dish with the onion mixture, white sauce, pancetta and Gruyère.",
    "Cover with foil and bake for about 1 hour, removing the foil halfway through."
  ]
